  "content": "\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"#YouAreLiterallyTheBest\"><center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RcSztyK.png\" alt=\"Dandelion X + 叢生葉片標題\"></center></a>\n<br><br><br>\n\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n\n<br>\n\n<kbd><font face=\"impact\" size=\"+2\">原生相容叢生葉片</font></kbd>\n<p>這是一個完全原生相容的附加包，專為<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/dandelion-x\">Dandelion X 材質包</a>設計，為每種葉片類型增添了獨特的形狀，賦予樹木嶄新的風貌。\n</p>\n\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cIOd5ziD/images/20c89b08ea25503df517a9a704bb45f91137236a.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CCr186P.png\" alt=\"叢生葉片 1\" width=\"275\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cIOd5ziD/images/a338e3c8eba515f91a32184402262dcd90b36825.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/44gtc24.png\" alt=\"叢生葉片 2\" width=\"275\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cIOd5ziD/images/bab702b0a8ca28db01397aedc35a034682ffb302.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vw3qozN.png\" alt=\"叢生葉片 3\" width=\"275\"></a>\n</center>  \n</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr></tr>\n\t<tr>\n\n<td width=\"500px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Ka9CwJrsBZ\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MPgqRxu.png\" style=\"float:left;\" alt=\"Dandelion Discord 圖示\" width=\"120px\">\n<br><font color=\"#7d8288\">加入</font><font color=\"#1bd96a\"><strong>Dandelion Discord</strong></font><font color=\"#7d8288\">，分享你的建築作品，搶先體驗新材質，並獲取未來 Dandelion X 更新的通知！</font>\n</a></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dcUMWaf.png\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<kbd><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m96DaoZ.png\" alt=\"附加包標題\"></kbd>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n\n<tr></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"600px\">\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/dandelion-x-emissive-ores\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dguUSnP.png\" style=\"float:left;\" alt=\"發光礦石附加包圖示\" width=\"200px\">\n<br>\n<kbd><font  face=\"impact\" size=\"+2\" color=\"#1bd96a\">+ 發光礦石</font></kbd><br>\n<font color=\"#7d8288\">一款基於原生的材質包，透過細膩、發光（有時帶有閃爍效果）的動態礦石紋理來強化 Dandelion X 的視覺效果</font></a>\n</td>\n</tr>\t  \n\t  \n\t \n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br><br>",
